<description>&lt;p&gt;UNMISS patrols continue in Tonj North while Tonj East hosts peace talks to curb intercommunal clashes, and the government sets conditions for Dr. Riek Machar's return to Juba. A drone strike killed at least 153 people, and a plane crash killed 14, adding large-scale fatalities to the crisis. A lightning strike killed a 60‑year-old man in Juba. Uganda demanded $4.3 million from Kenya over the killing of UPDF soldiers and geologists in Turkana. The UCDP recorded 2 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMilAFBVV95cUxNRUVabkx1TG9mazNsbXU0S0Nqc3ZvY2VNYjFIV3V5SVNnVExwc2tRVy0tQkhCQWR6X0Q5RXBraTdNeXJVejYyMFN2M2RPR2hYUXZPSWVHRlNwZWJ1N2VSbjVCT2prUU5vbm9ZNWJ6RVVCbjY1eFRIcnpuRy13QndDY3dlRkRYMEMwNU9NbUlsb09QR2tN?oc=5&quot;&gt;Dawan Africa&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiigFBVV95cUxNcEh2WVYwcE9JTHhQM3c4MXE4ZFFkZ0NTMmxLeU5LclpjcGIwVi0xT1lMZlZ6MGtOOWpUODNVWHdqa3hWUFNJUVlaUXN5cGRRRlRRazBpd2I5dV9SMC01QWQxQmI0Q2RKSXp0RFo5U0hJeVpZWmpBWU9idTlUaS1NeFRFbkpCQVhSVGc?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Tanzania Times&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMibkFVX3lxTE9kMVpNRk9HZGdLSzNuVVVTNFdIYnpLNHBNNjNHVVZIYk04RUtJU1BaTUxlSnN1Ni1ud3ZOTXJWZW1hSllxZ09RVlNHd2lWX1FiTzhkeTB5SkVaMGdacTAtYlZkN0ZSY3hCdHBJejJ3?oc=5&quot;&gt;Global Centre for the Responsibility to Protect&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMimAFBVV95cUxQZTBiTHNTMC1HZXR4VmRobC1SaVhWeE1aTk0ydEwtTEtJRXhrNmstdWpJWVBQcy1Lall4UUlpbWkxSE5kSkZtdWFhV1NhdUpEdDJuYkE1VXRDZGVPV3dpbGZNV3kwc21vOTR2S0pxczZRcXJ0TFJiRWk4U0JHUWxwMmc5ejdaVzVXYkZ4c0tKSGNJR25GOFZqZA?oc=5&quot;&gt;dailyasianage.com&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Eye Radio&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Eye Radio&lt;/a&gt;,